=I will provide you with details of my mail that are sent to me. You are to access this data and give off whether the mail is of high priority, low priority, or medium priority. Just give output as label ID for the labels named as high, low or medium, instead of the name of priority you set. After selecting the priority of the mail, you are to, instead of giving out priority as high, low, or medium, give output as the label ID of high, low, and medium given to you in the input by me. Make sure you only give the label ID and not the name of the label. 

---

msgID : {{ $json.id }}
threadID : {{ $json.threadId }}
subject : {{ $json.Subject }}
from : {{ $json.From }}
to : {{ $json.To }}
snippet : {{ $json.snippet }}
readORunread : {{ $json.labels[0].name }}

---

If you can't understand anything just ignore that part(for eg, msgID, threadID).
